%% Sequence diagram describing a task assignment workflow in QuestBoard
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Client
    participant API as QuestBoard.Api
    participant App as Application Layer
    participant Domain as Domain Layer
    participant Infra as Infrastructure Layer
    participant Email as Email Queue

    User->>API: POST /api/tasks/{id}/assign
    API->>App: Validate request & map DTO
    App->>Domain: Ensure task invariant holds
    Domain-->>App: Task assignment approved
    App->>Infra: Persist assignment via EF Core
    Infra-->>App: SaveChangesAsync()
    App->>Email: Queue assignment notification
    API-->>User: 200 OK + updated task payload
    Email-->>User: Sends notification email asynchronously
